  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 5.521,
      "end": 14.082,
      "en": "In the world today, there are still children who cannot receive even elementary education.",
      "ja": "今も世界には、elementary な教育さえ十分に受けられない子どもたちがいます。"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.582,
      "end": 23.583,
      "en": "In sub-Saharan Africa and South Asia, absence and dropout are serious problems.",
      "ja": "サハラ以南アフリカや南アジアの多くの地域では、absence や中途退学が深刻な問題です。"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.084,
      "end": 27.504,
      "en": "What blocks access to education?",
      "ja": "教育へのアクセスを妨げるものは何でしょうか。"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.904,
      "end": 35.565,
      "en": "Poverty, conflict, geographical isolation, and gender inequality.",
      "ja": "貧困、紛争、地理的な孤立、そして男女間の inequality です。"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.966,
      "end": 50.108,
      "en": "Families unable to pay school fees, villages where children must walk for hours to reach a school, customs that deny girls the right to attend.",
      "ja": "必要な fees を払えない家族、学校まで何時間も歩かなければならない村、女子の通学を妨げる差別的な慣行です。"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.408,
      "end": 54.648,
      "en": "These disadvantages create deep inequality.",
      "ja": "こうした disadvantages が、深い inequality を生み出します。"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.948,
      "end": 63.149,
      "en": "Yet many studies have shown that education is the most effective tool for breaking the cycle of poverty.",
      "ja": "多くの研究は、教育が貧困の連鎖を断つための、非常に effective な手段であることを示しています。"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.75,
      "end": 70.511,
      "en": "An educated woman tends to raise healthier children and to earn a higher income.",
      "ja": "十分に educate された女性は、より健康に子どもを育て、より高い所得を得る傾向があります。"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.623,
      "end": 77.672,
      "en": "The United Nations has set the goal, quality education for all by 2030.",
      "ja": "国連は2030年までに、すべての人へ包摂的で公正な質の高い教育を提供する目標を掲げています。"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.972,
      "end": 89.674,
      "en": "Through scholarships, the spread of digital learning, and the training of teachers, each country pursues its own path toward achievement.",
      "ja": "scholarships、digital な学習環境、教師研修を通じて、各国は目標の achievement へそれぞれの道を進めています。"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.814,
      "end": 100.875,
      "en": "With the spread of tablets and the internet, even remote areas are gaining access to educational content.",
      "ja": "タブレットとインターネットの普及により、remote な地域でも educational な内容へアクセスしやすくなっています。"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.416,
      "end": 106.716,
      "en": "Technology can be a great force in closing the gap in education.",
      "ja": "技術は、教育の gap を縮める大きな力になり得ます。"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.016,
      "end": 117.918,
      "en": "Education has the power to change not only the life of a single person but the whole of society.",
      "ja": "教育には、一人の人生だけでなく、社会全体を変える力があります。"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.478,
      "end": 129.94,
      "en": "That is why investment in education is the most efficient investment in the future.",
